size:14px;\">註:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. 以上資料只供參考。本行保留隨時更改利率之權利。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2. 利息以單息計算,&nbsp; 以每年365天(包括閏年)爲基礎計算。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"rateTableWrapper___GbWwk\"><div class=\"rateTableTitle___xLNZt\"></div><div class=\"rateTableBox___cVhtI\"><div class=\"rateTableHeader___THO_I\"></div><div class=\"rateTableList___o9vbz rateTableFirstList___XIou1\"><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div></div></div><div class=\"rateTableBox___cVhtI\"><div class=\"rateTableHeader___THO_I\"></div><div class=\"rateTableList___o9vbz rateTableFirstList___XIou1\"><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div><div class=\"rateTableItem____D2gE\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"article-content\"><p><br>&nbsp;</p></div></div></main></div></div></div><div class=\"btnBg___kzIrW \"><div class=\"btnArrow___gfqJE\"></div></div></div><div class=\"btnBg___kzIrW \"><div class=\"btnArrow___gfqJE\"></div></div></div><footer class=\"footer___jnJ9k\"><div data-aspm=\"ca9910_1920\" data-aspm-expo=\"true\" class=\"footerMain___qw_lR\"><a href=\"/home?lang=zh_hk\" title=\"螞蟻銀行（香港）\"><img class=\"logo___yNqST\" src=\"https://gw.alipayobjects.com/zos/bmw-prod/2ad479fa-b106-4184-b9c8-af487ac61cb6.svg\" alt=\"logo\"></a><div class=\"footerInfo___wMbWy\"><div class=\"footerLeft___yE6_O\"><ul class=\"clearfix\"><li class=\"navTitel___VL_k1\">網站地圖</li><li class=\"navItem___u3G7b\"><a href=\"/home?lang=zh_hk\" tabindex=\"0\">關於我們</a></li><li class=\"navItem___u3G7b\"><a href=\"/paylater-welcome-offer?lang=zh_hk\" tabindex=\"0\">最新優惠</a></li><li class=\"navItem___u3G7b\"><a href=\"/dzd?lang=zh_hk\" tabindex=\"0\">產品介紹</a></li><li class=\